# Keep text files at LF in every checkout.
#
# Run records in experiments/h3a_v1r2/ hash the exact bytes of the sources and
# artifacts they were produced from. Without a pinned eol, core.autocrlf=true
# checks the same commit out as CRLF on Windows and LF elsewhere, so the hashes
# differ across machines and a stored run cannot be verified from a fresh
# checkout. Pinning LF removes only that difference; a real source change still
# changes the hash.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets that must never be line-ending converted.
*.pt binary
*.parquet binary
*.npz binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pptx binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
